{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103181633485-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103191222\"/><p>檢獲的非法進口活鳥。</p><p>​香港海關今日（3日）在落馬洲支線管制站入境大堂，截查一名34歲抵港內地女旅客，經檢查後，在其個人行李內檢獲66隻裝載於鳥籠的懷疑非法進口活雀鳥，估計市值約3,000港元。該名女子隨即被捕。案件已轉交漁農自然護理署跟進。</p><p>根據《公眾衞生（動物及禽鳥）規例》，沒有有效健康證明書而進口禽鳥，即屬違法，一經定罪，最高可被罰款2.5萬0港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:04.982527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:16:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.525398+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:35.504077+00:00","content_hash":"092ac382b1c69471fa7daf155de4026a4bb2dbe4b088d6b6c2775cd419321ba7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:04.982527+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}